// Description: Detects cloud application events originating from IP addresses categorized as risky, potentially indicating malicious login attempts or compromised accounts
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1078 (Valid Accounts), T1110 (Brute Force), T1071 (Application Layer Protocol)
// Data Source: CloudAppEvents
// Severity: High
// False Positives: VPN users, corporate proxy exits, security researchers, travel-based logins

CloudAppEvents
| where IPCategory == "Risky"
| project Timestamp, AccountDisplayName, ActionType, IPAddress, IPCategory, ISP, RawEventData, DeviceType
